window.products.push({"id":340081,"name":"Shalinindia Pink and Orange Modern Floral Rectangular Tablecloth - 60 x 102 Inch Polysateen Digitally Printed Table Cloth Cover for Tables","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Fx3J8Gn8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Don't think it's possible to make your dining room table fun while still setting the tone for an elegant evening? Think again! The Pink and Orange Modern Floral rectangular Tablecloth is fashionable and fun, yet it's sophisticated and chic to give you that look you desire. Made by skilled artisans, the tablecloth is of the finest possible quality and can last through years of daily or special occasion use. With its fun, funky floral print, the Pink and Orange Modern Floral rectangular Tablecloth is sure to lift your spirits and set the mood for a lively meal. The design features a modern floral print that appears hand drawn and consists of an appealing mix of flowers and leaves. The center is hot pink with an orange print, while the rest of the tablecloth has a reverse pink on orange look. A satin finish makes the table cover light reflective for added beauty. To complete your tablescape, you can purchase table runners, place mats and napkins in coordinating colors and patterns separately. Measuring 60 inches by 102 inches in size, the Pink and Orange Modern Floral rectangular Tablecloth is made to fit tables that are rectangular in shape and sized. The tablecloth is fashioned out of premium 100 percent Polysateen Digitally Printed twill fabric, a material that is soft but thick enough to drape attractively without requiring ironing. Following a meal, you can toss the tablecloth into the washing machine and launder it in cold water without soaking to get it perfectly clean. Then, finish by line drying in the shade. Make your tablescape bold, fun and elegant with a lovely, modern tablecloth! Order the Pink and Orange Modern Floral rectangular Tablecloth now. Make this holiday season your Diwali Thanksgiving and Christmas party truly exceptional with vibrant table decorations items of ShalinIndia","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Fx3J8Gn8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shalinindia","source_asin":"B01BHXH8SK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-340081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BHXH8SK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BHXH8SK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
