window.products.push({"id":340183,"name":"Sapid Cookie Cutters Mold Silicone Baking Mat Set, Stainless Steel Biscuit Cutter with Christmas, Animals Shapes, Non-Stick Pastry Mats with Measureme","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i+d6nR0mL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Food Grade Materials】: Sapid cookies cutter set is including 10 pieces and a nonstick silicone baking mat(16\"×20\"). The shapes of the stainless steel cookies cutter are gingerbread man, snowflake, Christmas tree, bear, mickey mouse, house, heart, hat, Dog bones, overalls. All these cookie cutters are made of 430 stainless steel, which is durable and not easy bent. 【Easy to Use】: Our cookie cutters are 1” deeper than other plastic cutters, and the hand hold surface is design with smooth edges. No worry will hurt your hand. Our dough mat is double thickness 0.7mm than the 0.3mm one that sell in the market, which is safe for cookie cutter and protect countertop without scratch. 【Nonstick and Nonslip】: Silicone kneading mat has a non stick surface and anti-slip bottom. A non-stick pastry mat surface no need to use excess oil and less scraping. This non-skid rolling mat also can lay flat on the countertop perfectly when you rolling out the dough. 【Clean up is a breeze】: This holiday cookie cutters are waterproof and without rust. Thanks to the no sticky matericals of the pie mats surface, it's super easy to clean. Just rinsed it by warm soapy water and let air dried. The baking set can be stored in the box, which is really space-saving. 【Multifunctional Set】: The baking cutter with lovely shapes, which is suitable for all kind of occasion, like christmas, birthday party, valentines day etc. And the biscuit baking mat is withstand temperature from -30 to 480°F, which is oven and dishwasher safe. As the silicon baking mats with great heat resistance, it's suitable for countertop, table mats.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i+d6nR0mL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAPID","source_asin":"B0859FDR12","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-340183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0859FDR12","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0859FDR12","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
