window.products.push({"id":340203,"name":"Mocoosy 24 Pack Christmas Party Favor Bags, Xmas Party Goodie Treat Bags for Kids, Holiday Candy Bags Colorful Paper Gift Bags for Christmas Winter Bi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ztdd580CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Christmas Party Favor Supplies: This set includes 24 Christmas party gift bags with 8 different holiday classic designs, each design has 3 pieces. Plus, it comes with 3 types of stickers (snowman, Santa, and Christmas tree). The Xmas print is so cute and can go with so many different kids' party themes. Pretty strong to hold toys, candies, and any other gifts as party favor bags. Eye-catching Patterns: Our party goodie bags have 8 classic Christmas-themed patterns (Snowman, Elf, Santa, Gnome, Reindeer, and more) printed in vibrant colors. Coordinate these Xmas paper bags with other party supplies to create an eye-catching color scheme, or add beautiful decorations for some Christmas holiday-themed parties. Premium Quality: Made from high-quality and eco-friendly kraft paper plus it comes with stickers to seal the candy bags. They are thicker and more sturdy than a regular paper lunch sack, strong and with no smell, and easy to store for the next use. These kids' party bags are 6 inches wide, 8 1/4 inches tall, and 3 1/4 inches deep. Plenty big to hold lots of party favors or large ones. Perfect For Party Favors: These Christmas party bags with stickers would be ideal for kids' goody bags at any themed party. The vivid colors and adorable patterns were a big hit with the kids. Kids will absolutely love receiving these holiday party treat bags and be delighted to find out what awaits inside. Bring a lot of fun to your party. Multiple Occasions: Our Christmas treat bags are perfect for various occasions. These are great for gift bags for a kid’s birthday, and could easily be used for gifting small items at baby showers, holiday-themed parties, New Year, festivals, Xmas, or classroom handouts. Brighten up your activities with our Christmas gift bags, increasing the festival atmosphere.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ztdd580CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mocoosy","source_asin":"B0B141RYGF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-340203","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B141RYGF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B141RYGF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
