window.products.push({"id":340470,"name":"AIMU Gaming Chairs Ergonomic Office Chair Video Game Chairs with Footrest High Back Computer Chair Headrest and Lumbar Support Reclining Racing Chair ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":219.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BQh-zb9hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High Quality Material: A chair is where you spend a good bulk of you time sitting everyday. So our gaming chair made of premium quality PU leather which means comfortable, durable and no order smell. And we used the high quality padding and solid metal frame that is designed to help support a sitting position Ergonomic Gaming Chair: If you want to find a gaming chair that does not hurt your back after sitting for a few hours. This AIMU gaming chair is for you! The chair have a neck and lumbar pillow, which offer great support. You can use our gaming chair for gaming, watching Netflix, editing photos, working for long hours at a time Multi-Function: Reclining features 90-150 degree which allows easily lock the chairs tilt into a position of choice. It also have a footrest that your make your leg relax. The heavy duty base and smooth PU wheels provide great stability and mobility. It will roll well on carpet floor. In addition, you can adjust the armrests to up or down that position your arm naturally sit. The maximum Weight Capacity: 225lbs Easy to Assemble & Dimension: Just follow the instructions. Step by step. You will enjoy whole process and get the modern & comfortable gaming chair. Seat-height adjustment: 18.5\"-22.4\", Seating area dimension: 20\"X14.6\" , Back rest size: 22\"X33\", Footrest size: 14\"X8.2\" Satisfactions Guarantee: Our gaming chair with limited 2 years warranty! Each gaming chair was made at high standards and passed strict test before packaging to make sure all AIMU customers can get the best gaming chair and service. If you meets any problems, please contact us directly on amazon. We always help you","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BQh-zb9hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AIMU","source_asin":"B09LC9VZRH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-340470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LC9VZRH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LC9VZRH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":340471,"name":"SZXIMU Curtain Rod 3/4 Inch Single Drapery Rods for Windows with Netted Texture Finials, 72-144\"(6-12 ft), Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ayj4UFSvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Adjustable Curtain Rod: With telescoping structure, this single window treatment rod can extend from 72 to 144 inches, which is easily adjusted to fit a variety of window sizes and well adapted for your living room, bedroom, dining room, kitchen. Robust & Sturdy: Strong metal curtain rods of 3/4-inch diameter and 0.5 mm thickness, can withstand the curtains up to 30 lbs, provide a reliable support system to hang light, medium or heavy weight curtains. Attractive Vintage Design: Features with elegant netted texture resin finials and brackets, this decorative curtain rods with black finish add a simple and vintage appearance elements to your window style. Perfect Package, Easy Install:  SZXIMU drapery rod set comes ready with all telescoping rods, finials, brackets, screws, anchors and instruction, you can install the single curtain rod with grommet or rod pocket curtains easily. More Options, Worry Free: The window curtain rods are available for different sizes (36 to 72 inches, 72 to 144 inches ) and colors (black, bronze and nickel), perfect for blending with your existing window treatments and home décor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ayj4UFSvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SZXIMU","source_asin":"B08ZK8S9Q4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-340471","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZK8S9Q4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZK8S9Q4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":340472,"name":"Good Party recovery Balloon Set: Sobriety Celebrations - Sober Anniversary - Recovery Balloons - Party Decorations for AA Birthday or Milestone","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Syev7fGML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our exclusive recovery balloon set is the best way to decorate and celebrate your next sobriety themed festivity. These colorful balloons are a must-have at your next sober anniversary, birthday, talent show, barbecue -- the list goes on and on. After all, we are not a glum lot. If you or someone you care about is approaching a significant sobriety milestone, it's time to embrace the power of celebration. Recognizing and honoring the sobriety journey is an essential aspect of substance abuse recovery, and gives you and your loved ones the opportunity to rejoice in your remarkable accomplishment of staying clean and serene. As fellow friends of Bill W, we understand the importance of acknowledging the strength and courage worth celebrating during the recovery process, and that's why we’ve created a decoration with our favorite triangle symbol, that represents recovery, unity, and service. With many colors and a touch of inspiration, we know these fun and meaningful balloons will be the hit of your party. Don't miss the chance to uplift spirits, ignite conversations, and strengthen the bonds of your fellow trudging buddies. So stick with the winners, share your happiness, and don’t forget Rule #62: Don’t take yourself so seriously! I am responsible. When anyone, anywhere, reaches out for help, I want the hand of AA always to be there. And for that: I am responsible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Syev7fGML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Good Party","source_asin":"B07TLF3Y52","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-340472","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TLF3Y52","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TLF3Y52","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":340473,"name":"IMPRESA [2 Pack] Insulated Pour Over Coffee Cozy for Bodum 6 Cup Coffee Maker - Protective Sleeve for Coffee Carafe Glass - Hot or Cold Brew - Pour Ov","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PKDgqgTzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep Your Coffee at the Desired Temperature Drinking fresh, hot coffee is amazing, but burning your fingers in the process isn't. The Impresa cozy for Bodum coffee maker pour over carafe allows you to hold the glass coffee pot without scalding your fingers. The insulating sleeve helps prevent your piping hot coffee from losing heat inside the glass pour over coffee maker. If you're making cold brew coffee, the sleeve can help to prevent the refreshing iciness from going lukewarm. The sleeve also protects the beautiful coffee maker glass from unattractive scratches. Accessorize Your Coffee Maker Serve your guests a fragrant cup of joe from your fashionable pour over coffee maker with warmer. The stretch fabric on our cozy for Bodum 6 cup pour over coffee pot includes a zip closure. Your grey pour over coffee maker insulated sleeve complements any room decor where you take your coffee. This set of 2 covers allows you to always keep your coffee pour over dripper protected when one is in the wash.Keep your pour over carafe insulated with the Impresa cozy for Bodum pour over coffee set (1L / 6 Cup only. Not compatible with any other size.) Note: This is an aftermarket product manufactured by Impresa. Any other brands mentioned are for illustrative purposes only and are in no way affiliated with Impresa,nor do they endorse Impresa.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PKDgqgTzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IMPRESA","source_asin":"B0BNR3YSZW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-340473","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNR3YSZW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNR3YSZW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
