window.products.push({"id":340481,"name":"Yoolax Motorized Electric Blackout Curtain Texture Thermal Insulated Drapes Compatible with Alexa and Google Home Remote Control Smart Curtain Customi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":349.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GpJv4xt2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fabric Material：100% Blackout Polyester fabric, block out sunlight, and UV rays. Turn day into the night, enjoy the sweet sleeping. Protect your furniture from color fading and entire privacy at home. Washable by lower temperature water. Iron before shipment, wrinkles may appear after 5-7 days of transportation, so you may need to iron yourself when it arrived. ATTENTION: ONLY including the blackout drape, sheer drape need to order separately. Adjustable Smart Curtain Rod: DIY white curtain track length from 76.7” to 141.7”or 96.4\" to 181.1” by stretch out and draw back. Work with TuyaSmart app via Wi-Fi signal, set a timer on the APP. Compatible with Alexa, Google Assistant and IFTTT. Can also be controlled with the remote. If powered out, don’t worry, it can also be open and close by hand smoothly. EASY-TO-INSTALL & PACKAGE: All mounting kits, instructions are included in the package. The 2 channel remote be basically programmed before ship. Remote battery is NOT included. Curtain rod and fabric are packaged in 2 boxes. If you feel confused about the installation, you can contact us for the install video. In case the fabric touches the floor, we have deducted 1.7 inches height by default. Custom Size: You can see the “Customize now”button on the top right of the page. Then please follow the guide to place the order. We will send an email to all customers to double confirm the size in 24 hours, please attention to the email the day after your order. And other special sizes you can contact us via Amazon message. We appreciate our customer to buy the fabric samples to decide which color to buy. SHIPPING & SERVICE: Usually dispatched in 4-5 workdays after size confirmed. Receiving damage of fabric or components, please take photos, claim to send to Amazon message within 30 days, we'll work with you for free replacement in this valid time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GpJv4xt2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yoolax","source_asin":"B07ZJBTM5Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-340481","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZJBTM5Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZJBTM5Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
