window.products.push({"id":340577,"name":"UltraCeramics Color Ceramic Knife Set - 4 Sizes of Kitchen Knives with Clear Blade Covers in Gift Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OJesG8jWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"PREPARE TO BE DELIGHTED!! Bring a rainbow of colors to your kitchen with Beejays UltraCeramic 4 color premium knife set . These knives are made from Zirconium Oxide which is second only to diamonds in hardness.  Ceramic knives differ from steel knives in that they are much lighter to use, ultra sharp making  precision slicing and dicing easy and pleasurable every time.   Each knife is easily recognisable with its individually colored handle while adding beauty to your kitchen.  The handles are egonomically designed to provide super comfort for extended use. Included in your gift box is: One of each: 6 inch Chef Knife - Red  5 inch Utility Knife - Green  4 inch Fruit Knife - Blue  3 inch Paring Knife - Yellow  4 Clear Blade Covers  Elegant Gift Box - A perfect gift for all special occasions and those budding chefs in your life Usage and Care Advice: SUPER SHARP - replace each clear blade cover after cleaning, keep knives away from children Great for cutting/slicing/dicing of fruits, bread, vegetables and boneless meats DO NOT USE FOR CUTTING HARD, FROZEN OR BONED FOODS Avoid cutting on marble, stone or glass surfaces - Use with a plastic or wooden cutting board   Wash by hand in soapy water. Do not place in dishwasher   For discolorations not removed by normal washing, wash the blade only in a mild bleach solution Use ceramic knife sharpener only - do not sharpen with ordinary knife sharpener Beejays Kitchen's UltraCeramic 4 Color Premium Knife Set brings more life, fun and love to your kitchen Our Ceramic Kives come with a Five year 100% hassle-free guarantee BUY NOW - DON'T MISS OUT","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OJesG8jWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UltraCeramics","source_asin":"B00T4VATVQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-340577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00T4VATVQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00T4VATVQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":340578,"name":"Fish Bone/Ric-Rac Cactus - Epiphyllum anguliger - 2.5\" Pot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ELEcSe05L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This orchid cactus relative has serrated leaves that resemble fish bones. The Ric-Rac cactus is one of the easiest plants to grow in hanging baskets. Like many shade loving cactus, the ric-rac prefers smaller baskets with a very porous soil. As the plant grows and gets rootbound the plant can be repotted to a bigger basket. Rik Rac will grow better in bright shade and can even handle a little bit of direct sun as long as it is not too hot. In nature ric-racs grow as Epiphytes (like orchids) forming dense clusters cascading down from the branches of trees. Like many orchids they can handle quite a bit of water, as long as the drainage is very good. For basket culture, it is better to allow the soil to dry out a little bit between waterings. During the winter, the soil should be kept a little dryer and fertilizer should be kept to a minimum. In old and rootbound plants, flowers may appear around March/April. At this time watering can be increased along with the fertilization. A liquid fertilizer like the ones used for orchids work very well. Selenicereus are tropical forest cactus and even though they can withstand temperatures outside near freezing it is better to keep the plant above 40° F. They make a good indoor plant for homes in colder locations. Trimming occasionally will be necessary because some leaves will get quite long. Use gloves when doing this because the ric-rac is still a cactus and its thorns despite being small and almost invisible, can puncture the skin.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ELEcSe05L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hirt's Gardens","source_asin":"B09ZNW559P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-340578","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZNW559P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZNW559P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
