window.products.push({"id":340625,"name":"Birthday Gifts for Child Dream Catcher 7.9\" Handmade Half Circle Moon Design Dream Catchers Feather Hanging with Star Home School Nursery Bedroom Craf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mqKGMJsTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Traditional use -- Dreamcatcher comes from the 18th century. It is a traditional culture of Native Americans. They believe that a dreamcatcher capture dreams and bring blessings. Nightmares pass through the holes and out of the window. The good dreams are trapped in the web, and then slide down the feathers to the sleeping person. Our advantage: Material High Quality Leather rope, cotton line, real feather, wood beads, metal hoop. Handcraft All our dream catcher are woven by our hand workers with long expericences in knitting,so that the web will looks falt and evenly. Dream Catchers -- With 2 wishing bottle and wall hook. You can write your dream or hopes in the wishing bottle. Wall hooks can let the dream catcher to hang anywhere you want. Specification: Dia of Circle: 7.9inch / 20cmTotal length: About 23.62inch / 60cmWeight: 60g A Perfect Gifts for parents, kids, friends!! -- Super Cute Design, they will love it. A perfect gift for birthday, anniversaries, Christmas and New Year. Can be used to decor home, nursery, party, children's room! -- Match with the interior decoration of your room, dream catcher is your best choice.-- Contracted style, let the room appear comfort, ease and warm atmosphere-- The feather dream catcher really help children sleep better and prevent nightmares, can bring lots of good dream for your kids in all night. Cute Gift Package！ 1 * Dream Catcher1* Envelope gift bag1 * wall hook2 * blessing bottle","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mqKGMJsTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"wellinc","source_asin":"B07S8K7JQ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-340625","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S8K7JQ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S8K7JQ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":340626,"name":"MIER Insulated Backpack Cooler Small Leakproof Lunch Back Pack with Coolers Lightweight Cute Lunch Bag for Women Men to Work, Picnics, Camping, Park D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bS1HEuwhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Polyester & PEVA liner Imported 【Insulated Cooler Backpack】: This Insulated back pack uses 5mm thicken insulation and food grade PEVA lining to keep foods cold or warm for hours. The exterior material-600D polyester & water-resistant fabric protects the contents from the rains or scratches. Heat-welded seams of liner make sure NO LEAKING and longer insulation effect 【Cute Lunch Back Pack with Simple Style】: This cooler back pack is designed with a classic day pack style. 1 main compartment is roomy enough for keeping drinks, tall beverages, fruits, lunch box and meal container fresh/ cold/ warm. 1 small front pocket can hold your your keys, wallet, coins, cards, etc. 2 side mesh pockets for your water bottles and umbrellas 【Durable and Comfy Backpack Cooler】: The adjustable padded shoulder straps are sturdy and comfortable to wear, and make it convenient to carry for long time. Heavy duty dual zippers and reinforced treatment on the stress points provide long-lasting durability against daily activities. High quality material guarantees your satisfaction. The leakproof liner is easy to clean, just wipe it off with wet cloth or napkins 【Lightweight Lunch Backpack for Women】: Exterior dimension: 16.5*12*4.75 inch/ 42*30.5*12cm. Weight: 0.8 LB/ 370g. Capacity: 15 L. It is plenty of room for you to pack 1-2 person’s daily lunch. It can hold up to 16 cans of 330ml drinks and still have room for ice packs. Ideal as a lunch cooler, daypack for women 【Versatile Thermal Backpack for Your Best Choice】: With modern simple style, 4 colors available, MIER insulated backpack is ideal as a lunch bag, beach cooler or daily pack. Perfect for picnics, travel, camping, park, road trip, etc. It’s a best choice for women as a gift THIS ITEM IS NOT INTENDED FOR USE BY CHILDREN 12 AND UNDER","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bS1HEuwhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIER","source_asin":"B09PY8Y2R3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-340626","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PY8Y2R3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PY8Y2R3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
