window.products.push({"id":340740,"name":"PARAGON Theater Pop 6-Ounce Popper Popcorn Machine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":972.42,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UpKSpApCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Styled just like the poppers you see at the local movie house. The Theater Pop line has a bright cabinet and classic graphics that fit almost any décor. Each full-featured machine pops delicious, theater-quality popcorn in 3-5 minutes, is easy to use and easy to maintain. This popcorn machine creates 113 one ounce servings per hour for maximum output, and its spring-assisted kettle makes it easy to unload popcorn when it's done cooking. Its two-switch operation lets you effortlessly operate the machine. The aerated warming deck keeps your food warm while catching kernels and smaller bits for easy cleaning. Amazon.com With the advent of HDTVs, Blu-Ray players, and surround sound systems, it's easier than ever to re-create the movie theater experience in the comfort of your own home. Now Paragon lets you take the next step in movie theater simulation with its TP-6 Theater Pop 6-ounce popcorn machine. Enjoy movie-style popcorn at home with Paragon's TP-6 Popcorn Machine. Styled just like the poppers you see at the local movie house, the TP-6 has a bright red cabinet and classic graphics that fit almost any decor. More importantly, the popcorn machine produces the same buttery goodness as movie theater machines but without charging $6 a pop. Easy to use and easy to maintain, the TP-6 pops 113 one-ounce servings per hour, and can produce a single batch of theater-quality popcorn in three to five minutes. The TP-6 measures 20 by 26 by 14 inches (W x H x D) and weighs 73 pounds. Features: Measures 20 inches wide by 14 inches deep by 26 inches tall Measures 20 inches wide by 14 inches deep by 26 inches tall Weighs 73 pounds Weighs 73 pounds Lower heating element for long-lasting popcorn Lower heating element for long-lasting popcorn Old Maid's Tray for catching unpopped corn Old Maid's Tray for catching unpopped corn Hard coat anodized aluminum kettle Hard coat anodized aluminum kettle Stainless steel food zone Stainless steel food zone Tempered glass panels Tempered glass panels Built-in warming deck Built-in warming deck Volts:120 Volts:120 Watts: 1200 Watts: 1200 Amps: 10 Amps: 10","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UpKSpApCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Paragon","source_asin":"B000212NU2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-340740","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000212NU2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000212NU2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":340741,"name":"EdgeMod Poly and Bark Organic Arm Chair, Black (Set of 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VrKyhqViL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Organic Chair was designed in 1940 for the New York Museum of Modern Art's \"Organic Design in Home Furnishings\" competition. Technically advanced, the impressive seat was not put into series production until after 1950, when technology had matured enough to manufacture larger quantities of the organically shaped seat shells. Eero S. designed the sought-after Organic Chair in conjunction with Charles E., combining the creative design vision and talent of two of the most significant designers of the 20th century. Poly and Bark produces the Organic Chair in a hand-formed shell, upholstered with quality twill fabric in various colors. Set Includes: 2 Chairs Overall Product Dimensions: 25\"L x 28.5\"W x 35\"H Seat Height: 18.5\"L x 16\"W x 18.5\"H Armrest Dimensions: 6\"W x 8\"H Backrest Height: 18\"H.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VrKyhqViL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EdgeMod","source_asin":"B00Q4VV116","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-340741","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Q4VV116","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Q4VV116","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
