window.products.push({"id":340829,"name":"Weathered Wooden Framed Mirror (Light Blue and Yellow)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919qC913dWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mirrors not only reflect your image, but they reflect your style. The types of mirrors you choose to hang in your home not only provide function, but act as a great accent piece that shows your sense of style apart and reflects your taste. Made from durable wood and accented with distressed finishes, beveled edges, and weathered details that give them a rustic, vintage look, these mirrors add beauty to any wall in any room of the house. Perfect for use in an entry way, a hallway, a dining room, a living room, or a bedroom, these rustic mirrors have that vintage inspired French country look that adds instant charm and casual comfort to any home. For a unique look and an interesting display, hang mirrors of different sizes, shapes, and colors on the same wall. Mirrors help to add texture and dimension and create the illusion of a larger space. By hanging multiple mirrors in a small space, you can create interest and increase the perceived size and feel of the space around you. Available in both rectangular shapes and rectangular shaped frames with oval mirrors in the center, these rustic wood mirrors come in a variety of color finishes that have a neutral appeal and can be easily coordinated with any type of rustic furniture or shabby chic room decor. With the look and feel of a treasured family heirloom, these mirrors are aged and weathered to give them a vintage look and evoke a sense of old fashioned spirit. Reminiscent of something you may have once seen in a charming country cottage, these wooden mirrors let you check out your own reflection as well as reflect the beautiful room around you. The antique look makes them the perfect addition to any casual space while the clean mirrored glass provides the function that aged and worn mirrors often cannot.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919qC913dWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Parisian Home","source_asin":"B00MMK524U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-340829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MMK524U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MMK524U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
