window.products.push({"id":340940,"name":"Cordless Blackout Bamboo Roller Shades, Woven Wood Roll Up Window Blinds with Lining, Light Filtering Roll Up Bamboo Roman Shades for Windows, Doors, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":67.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816sqMpKb1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MOUNT TYPES: Inside mounted shades will have a deduction taken of approximately 0.4\" to ensure a proper fit inside the window frame.Inside mounted shades require a minimum frame depth of 3.5inch for secure installation. If your window frame depth is less than 2.5inch please select outside mount.Outside mounted shades should be ordered with the exact width of the area you wish to cover. Outside mounts are often used when there is not sufficient frame depth for inside mounting.Our shades come with all mounting hardware, and mounting hardware for both inside mount and outside mount INSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the inside frame width at three locations-the top,middle,and bottom. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use that number deduct 1/4inch as your inside width when ordering. Step 2. Measure the height at 3 locations-the left,middle,and right side. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use the number as your inside width when ordering. OUTSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the outside frame width adding 6-10inch to be the outside mount width. Step 2. Measure the outside frame length adding 5-10inch to be the outside mount length. The overlap it recommended to allow appropriate coverage and avoid any light gaps. Type: Bamboo Roller Shades Feature: Light Filtering Material: Polyester Fabric Installation: All Mounting Hardware Included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816sqMpKb1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PASSENGER PIGEON","source_asin":"B08LZ2WJCW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-340940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LZ2WJCW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LZ2WJCW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":340941,"name":"Lauon Food Cover Food Tent, Large Pop-up Mesh Food Cover, 8 Pack Colored Screen Tent Patio Bug Net for Outdoors, Parties Picnics, BBQ, Reusable and Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41c2xmF9s7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Lauon Mesh Food Cover is committed to providing consumers with good-quality products and services. Indeed, little animals can smudge our food and spread disease. Now our food cover tent help you protect your food safely. Enjoy your healthy life. Features: 1. Material: Superior quality stainless steel framework and food Safe materials, Beautiful white lace around, High-density nylon mesh net. You are completely assured about the aesthetics, the tents serve as great functional decor, both keeping insects out while adding an elegant touch to any event.  2. Perfect Size: 8 Inches tall and 17 Inch square, Large enough to contain a party-sized platter of food, and tall enough to shelter a good-sized pot, plates with food up to 8\" height, it almost can accommodate cover most types plates or bowls.  3. Collapsible &Portable: It’s simple to use & store! Just takes 3 seconds to expand or collapse them for easy storage. Easy to take it anywhere, can be hanged for storage.  4. Washable & Reusable: Remove stains by simply wiping these tents with a damp cloth. More stubborn stains may be quickly hand washed. Air drying is recommended.  5. Multiple Function: Help to keep your food & fruits away from little animals, dirt, dust & debris, Protect your plant seedling from grasshopper, snails, slugs or bird eating.  6. Using Area: Kitchen, Family Holidays, Backyard BBQ, Outdoor Picnic, Camping, Banquet, Big Party. Package Included: 8Pcs Food Cover - 4 Colors (Blue,Purple,Green,White) X2 Warm Notice: 1.When you open or close them, don't try to force them, please handle these with some care to prevent breaking them.  2.When you use it to protect your plants from squirrels/birds, you need put something to tie/weigh them down in case of wind blow it away.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41c2xmF9s7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KeeygoLauon","source_asin":"B07XXDCKCK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-340941","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XXDCKCK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XXDCKCK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
